Every backend member writes the DTOs for **their own module**. Validation has two layers:

| Layer | Where | Examples |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Format | DTO classes (`class-validator`) | non-empty string, valid blood type (`O-`..`AB+`), integer `unitsRequired` between `1` and `10`, valid phone format, real calendar date `YYYY-MM-DD`, unknown fields rejected (`forbidNonWhitelisted: true`) |
