#### Validation Pipe (`common/validation.pipe.ts` — Owner: Eyad)

`createValidationPipe()` returns a NestJS `ValidationPipe` configured with:

```text
transform: true
whitelist: true
forbidNonWhitelisted: true
stopAtFirstError: true
exceptionFactory → BadRequestException with ONE readable message string
```

When an unknown property is sent in a body or query, `forbidNonWhitelisted: true` causes the factory to return `400 Bad Request` with `{ "message": "Unknown field '<property>' is not allowed." }`.

