- Prisma schema validates and migrations apply cleanly (`npx prisma migrate dev` in `api/`)
- Backend compiles and starts (`npm run start:dev` in `api/`) and Swagger loads at `http://localhost:3000/api/docs`
- Frontend type-checks and builds cleanly (`npm run build` in `client/`)
- Feature works end-to-end with the real PostgreSQL database, not only Phase 0 stubs
